00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:04.150
Speaker 1: I don't really care very much about
the White House Correspondents Association

00:00:04.150 --> 00:00:05.150
dinner.

00:00:05.150 --> 00:00:09.309
This is a dinner that Donald Trump would not
attend, but that typically presidents go to

00:00:09.309 --> 00:00:13.990
and you schmooze with the people who are covering
your presidency.

00:00:13.990 --> 00:00:16.030
Jokes are told they bring in comedians.

00:00:16.030 --> 00:00:18.520
This year, the comedian was Trevor Noah.

00:00:18.520 --> 00:00:22.570
It's not really an event I care about and
I thought about covering it live and then

00:00:22.570 --> 00:00:24.600
decided I don't even really care about it.

00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:26.340
I don't think I'm going to cover it.

00:00:26.340 --> 00:00:29.960
But there are a few interesting moments from
it that I want to go over.

00:00:29.960 --> 00:00:31.090
And these are from Joe Biden.

00:00:31.090 --> 00:00:34.870
Now, of course, Joe Biden didn't write this
stuff, but it doesn't matter.

00:00:34.870 --> 00:00:38.730
The points that that are made here are interesting
and they're pretty funny.

00:00:38.730 --> 00:00:44.329
One aspect of this that was sort of controversial
was that to go to this event, you had to provide

00:00:44.329 --> 00:00:48.510
proof that you were not only double vaccinated
against COVID, but also boosted.

00:00:48.510 --> 00:00:52.150
And Fox News has a table or at least one table,
maybe multiple tables at this event.

00:00:52.150 --> 00:00:54.590
And, of course, on air.

00:00:54.590 --> 00:00:58.440
Fox News has run significant anti-vaccine
interference.

00:00:58.440 --> 00:01:00.780
Hilariously, they were there.

00:01:00.780 --> 00:01:04.239
And Joe Biden pointed out one of the great
things about this event is you can look at

00:01:04.239 --> 00:01:08.420
the people sitting at the Fox News table,
know that regardless of what they're saying

00:01:08.420 --> 00:01:11.020
on air, they are vaccinated and boosted.

00:01:11.020 --> 00:01:12.020
Check this out.

00:01:12.020 --> 00:01:16.030
Speaker 4: We're here to show the country
that we're getting through this pandemic.

00:01:16.030 --> 00:01:21.400
Plus, everyone had to prove they're fully
vaccinated and boost it.

00:01:21.400 --> 00:01:28.810
So if you're at home watching this and you're
wondering how to do that, just contact your

00:01:28.810 --> 00:01:31.170
favorite fox news reporter.

00:01:31.170 --> 00:01:36.830
They're all here vaccinated and boost it all
on.

00:01:36.830 --> 00:01:43.280
Speaker 1: And there it cuts to Peter Doocy,
one of the main antagonists of White House

00:01:43.280 --> 00:01:45.509
Press Secretary Jen Psaki.

00:01:45.509 --> 00:01:47.450
I mean, listen, it it is on.

00:01:47.450 --> 00:01:53.580
It is, on the one hand, a relatively kind
of cheap joke and obvious line.

00:01:53.580 --> 00:01:57.840
And the people who most need to hear it probably
aren't watching this event.

00:01:57.840 --> 00:02:04.280
But it is a great reminder that many of the
people making you question whether you should

00:02:04.280 --> 00:02:11.640
go and get the COVID vaccine by using spurious
claims and non evidence based reporting.

00:02:11.640 --> 00:02:13.530
They are vaccinated.

00:02:13.530 --> 00:02:14.530
They're vaccinated.

00:02:14.530 --> 00:02:19.730
And you could say, well, they're vaccinated
by force because they needed to in order to.

00:02:19.730 --> 00:02:20.730
Well, not really.

00:02:20.730 --> 00:02:23.950
I mean, Fox News had an option for not being
vaccinated.

00:02:23.950 --> 00:02:26.810
You could choose to test daily if that's what
you wanted to do.

00:02:26.810 --> 00:02:30.540
But they are making you hesitant to go and
get a vaccine.

00:02:30.540 --> 00:02:32.140
They are vaccinated.

00:02:32.140 --> 00:02:34.950
They are having a good time at the White House
Correspondents Dinner.

00:02:34.950 --> 00:02:36.340
So that was a good moment.

00:02:36.340 --> 00:02:39.940
Now, for all we know, they don't know they
bought fake vaccine cards.

00:02:39.940 --> 00:02:45.310
Seems risky as a member of a prominent media
outlet to use a fake vaccination certificate

00:02:45.310 --> 00:02:48.800
or card to get into a White House correspondents
dinner.

00:02:48.800 --> 00:02:50.160
So probably not.

00:02:50.160 --> 00:02:52.470
Laura Ingram, by the way, reportedly was there.

00:02:52.470 --> 00:02:54.990
She's been a major anti-vaxx voice.

00:02:54.990 --> 00:03:00.670
